## Room layouts and how they connect. LINKS and LAYOUTS below are generated by
## tools/build_rooms.py: edit the rooms there and rerun it.
##
## Legend:  #  solid stone      .  empty          ^  spikes
##          P  start position   E  the region's enemy (beetle / thrall / ash bat / spark wisp)  *  shockline anchor
##          U  a burrow grub, waiting in the earth
##          I / F / L  ice, fire and lightning blade pieces (dash, double jump, shockline)
##          W          the sword catcher technique (wall jump)
##          R  rest shrine      H  mask shard (+1 max health)
##          B  the room's boss (BOSSES)          ?  a sign (SIGNS, in reading order)
##          a-z  door cells on the room's edge; LINKS says where each one leads.
##          =  a thin earth lid that gives way when the room's boss wakes (gone once beaten)
##          G  the frozen gate: solid ice until the room's boss is beaten

